# Build contexts for the Fly images (the API and the three Next.js apps) are the
# repository root. Deploys run from a fresh clone (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md); this
# keeps the context small and keeps local secrets and build output out of any
# image built by hand.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-preview
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
tmp
artifacts
.playwright-mcp
.codex*
.agents
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
